// A box that a `for` takes out of the box it is in (`was.disconnect()`,
// of the edge it visits): the others there take its room, in the same
// frame. Among many boxes, where the passes go only to what their events
// lead to: that a box lost one is such an event, which what happens to
// the tree after it must not wipe out.
// RUN: %ent run -I %S/../../examples %S/Inputs/layout_leave.ent 2>/dev/null | FileCheck %s

// Four share the 290 of the row.
// CHECK:      1: 7 at 10.0 wide 290.0
// CHECK-NEXT: 1: 1 at 10.0 wide 72.5
// CHECK-NEXT: 1: 2 at 82.5 wide 72.5
// CHECK-NEXT: 1: 3 at 155.0 wide 72.5
// CHECK-NEXT: 1: 4 at 227.5 wide 72.5
// Three do, where the second is in the row no more (it is as it was).
// CHECK:      2: 7 at 10.0 wide 290.0
// CHECK-NEXT: 2: 1 at 10.0 wide 96.666664
// CHECK-NEXT: 2: 2 at 82.5 wide 72.5
// CHECK-NEXT: 2: 3 at 106.666664 wide 96.666664
// CHECK-NEXT: 2: 4 at 203.333328 wide 96.666664
// CHECK:      3: 1 at 10.0 wide 96.666664
